 "unreadable": [
  "Slashed zeros read as 0 (e.g. P0.13, RX0, TX0)"
 ],
 "notes": "Labels use the nRF52840 port name (P0.xx/P1.xx, 'Micro' column) where printed, else the board/power name; USB_DM/USB_DP are not GPIO names so kept as functions. Power-direction tags (IN/OUT), 'D' default icons and LED icons omitted; RESET overbar not representable. Image 3 is an 'Advanced Section' warning page with no pins. Skipped: USB signal callouts in images 1-2 (lines merge into one trunk, no per-pin positions), LED callouts (LED_BUILTIN, Power, RGB LED), bottom-view callouts pointing at a few header pads (~D8/~D7 NFC, 3V3/GND battery jumper, 5V/VBUS jumper) since no full row map is given."
}
